    {
      "slug": "threading-35mm",
      "title": "Threading a 35 mm print, slowly",
      "date": "2026-10-12",
      "categories": [
        "from-the-booth"
      ],
      "tags": [
        "projection",
        "35mm"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/projector.webp",
      "excerpt": "Twenty minutes, two reels and a lot of patience: what happens in the booth before the lights go down.",
      "content": "<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>A feature on 35 mm arrives in five or six heavy cans. Mio splices them onto one large platter the night before, checking every join by hand.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>On the day, threading takes twenty quiet minutes. Nobody is allowed to talk in the booth while the film is going through the gate.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->"
    },
    {
      "slug": "why-silent-saturdays",
      "title": "Why we keep Silent Saturdays",
      "date": "2026-10-08",
      "categories": [
        "programme-notes"
      ],
      "tags": [
        "silent-film",
        "live-music"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/hero.webp",
      "excerpt": "A silent film with live piano is the most crowded screening of our week. Here is why.",
      "content": "<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Our resident accompanist watches each film four times before she plays it. She never writes the music down.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The room is different on Saturdays: nobody checks a phone, and the children laugh first.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->"
    },
    {
      "slug": "the-foyer-garden",
      "title": "The foyer garden in October",
      "date": "2026-10-03",
      "categories": [
        "the-cinema"
      ],
      "tags": [
        "garden"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/foyer.webp",
      "excerpt": "The morning glories are closing for the year. We have saved the seeds for the fence.",
      "content": "<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The fence was planted by the first owner in 1987, and every year a regular brings seeds back from her own garden.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>This week we collected two jars of seeds. Members can take a packet home from the window.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->"
    },
    {
      "slug": "student-shorts",
      "title": "Paper Lanterns: three student shorts",
      "date": "2026-09-28",
      "categories": [
        "programme-notes"
      ],
      "tags": [
        "shorts"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/reels.webp",
      "excerpt": "Tuesday's programme is three short films from the fictional Hamaura Film School, with the directors in the room.",
      "content": "<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Every Tuesday we give the screen to new filmmakers. This month, three students made films about the street they grew up on.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Tickets are ¥1,300 and the talk afterwards is free.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->"
    },
    {
      "slug": "a-year-of-long-shadows",
      "title": "A year of Long Shadows",
      "date": "2026-09-20",
      "categories": [
        "from-the-booth"
      ],
      "tags": [
        "documentary"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/projector.webp",
      "excerpt": "The documentary about a retired projectionist was partly filmed in our booth. A note on lending it out.",
      "content": "<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>For twelve months a small crew came on Thursday nights and filmed the last reel change of the evening.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We see ourselves in the background of one scene. It is strange, and rather lovely.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->"
    },
    {
      "slug": "restoring-the-house-on-kiri-street",
      "title": "Restoring The House on Kiri Street",
      "date": "2026-09-14",
      "categories": [
        "programme-notes"
      ],
      "tags": [
        "restoration",
        "35mm"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/hero.webp",
      "excerpt": "Monday's film was restored from a faded print found in a fictional film society's cupboard.",
      "content": "<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The colours had turned pink with age. The restorers rebuilt them frame by frame from two other copies.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We will show it in the morning, when the light outside is the colour of the film.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->"
